    "enUS": {
      "description": "Let's see if we can keep this crowd's excitement goin'.\r\n\r\nThis next contender ain't no joke.\r\n\r\nBest of luck to ya! See you soon, maybe.",
      "dialogue": {
        "6b0e6b4649df575ce419": "Let's see if we can keep this crowd's excitement goin'.\n\nThis next contender ain't no joke.\n\nBest of luck to ya! See you soon, maybe.",
        "a53dfea42ccecbf9dcb2": "Alright, big shot. Where the heck did you say you was from again?\n\nYou're startin' to make me look bad here."
      },
